/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Support for the CPC comes from various sources, including individuals, corporations, and foundations, whose generosity enables our work. We express our gratitude to these donors, and you can find the complete list of CPC supporters on our annual reports.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
