560 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Corporate partners of CPC gain access to our expert network, contribute to strategic policy dialogues, and align with a leading institute in regional discourse on Trans-Caspian energy, security, and politics. More information about the CPC Corporate Membership Program is available by email.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [8]
>>
